te;right:.25rem;top:1rem;font-size:1.25rem;color:#1B1F3C}.xyz-content .sv-faq details[open] summary::after{content:\"–\"}.xyz-content .sv-faq details p{margin:0 0 1.25rem;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.7;max-width:46rem}@media (max-width:900px){.xyz-content .hp-cards,.xyz-content .sv-tiles,.xyz-content .hp-tiers,.xyz-content .sv-fees,.xyz-content .sv-steps4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr!important}.xyz-content .sv-quiz{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xyz-content .sv-quiz-q{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule)}}@media (max-width:640px){.xyz-content .hp-cards,.xyz-content .sv-tiles,.xyz-content .hp-tiers,.xyz-content .sv-fees,.xyz-content .sv-steps4{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.xyz-content .hp-shell{padding-inline:1.25rem}}</style>\n<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-hero sv-hero\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"sv-crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Services</span></nav>\n<h1 class=\"hp-h1\">Online accounting services</h1>\n<p class=\"hp-lede\">Fixed fees, done entirely online, and lodged by a registered tax agent.</p>\n<div class=\"hp-cta-row\"><span class=\"hp-start-wrap\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get started</a><span class=\"hp-start-note\">Free to sign up · fixed fees</span></span><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-ghost\" href=\"/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a></div>\n<div class=\"hp-trust\"><span><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/identity-verification/\" style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Every client ID-verified</a> — no exceptions</span><span class=\"hp-trust-sep\">·</span><span>Registered Tax Agent</span><span class=\"hp-trust-sep\">·</span><span>FCPA, CPA Australia</span><span class=\"hp-trust-sep sv-review-slot\" hidden>·</span><span class=\"sv-review-slot\" hidden><!-- REVIEW SCORE: add the real rating here, then remove hidden from both review-slot spans --></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Where to start</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">What do you need?</h2>\n<div class=\"sv-tiles\"><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#start-a-business\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">01</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Start a business</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Companies, ABNs, GST, business names, trusts, partnerships and SMSFs.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See setup services</span></a><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#run-your-business\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">02</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Run your business</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Bookkeeping, BAS and GST, and your company&#8217;s annual ASIC compliance.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See ongoing services</span></a><a class=\"sv-tile\" href=\"#lodge-a-tax-return\"><span class=\"sv-tile-n\">03</span><span class=\"sv-tile-h\">Lodge a tax return</span><span class=\"sv-tile-p\">Individual, company, partnership, trust and SMSF returns, and super refunds.</span><span class=\"sv-tile-go\">See tax returns</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-white\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"start-a-business\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-head\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Start a business</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Set the business up properly the first time</h2>\n</div>\n<p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">Registrations and structures, done in the right order by a registered agent.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-cards\">\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/company-registration/\">Company setup</a></h3>\n<p>A Pty Ltd registered with ASIC — name, ACN, constitution, shares and directors.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$299 + ASIC fee</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">1 business day</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/company-registration/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/abn-application/\">ABN application</a></h3>\n<p>An ABN for the right entity, or a straight answer that you don&#8217;t need one.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$99</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">1–3 business days</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/abn-application/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\">GST registration</a></h3>\n<p>Registered from the correct date, on the reporting cycle that suits you.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$69</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">1–2 business days</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/gst-registration/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/business-name-registration/\">Business name registration</a></h3>\n<p>Trade under the name you want, checked for availability and trade mark clashes.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$79 + ASIC fee</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">1 business day</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/business-name-registration/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\">Trust setup</a></h3>\n<p>A discretionary family trust as standard, or a unit trust where the owners need fixed shares.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $649 + any duty</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">2–3 business days</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/trust-setup/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\">Partnership setup</a></h3>\n<p>TFN, ABN and a written partnership agreement, so everyone knows their share.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$449</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">2–3 business days</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/smsf/\">SMSF setup</a></h3>\n<p>A self-managed super fund established, registered and ready to take rollovers.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $749</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">1–2 weeks</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/smsf/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"run-your-business\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-head\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Run your business</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Keep it compliant, year after year</h2>\n</div>\n<p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">The recurring work that keeps the ATO and ASIC happy and June uneventful.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-cards\">\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">Bookkeeping</a></h3>\n<p>Books reconciled every month, so your numbers are right when you need them.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $199 / month</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Monthly</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/bas-gst-lodgement/\">BAS &#038; GST lodgement</a></h3>\n<p>Your BAS prepared from your books, checked and lodged before it is due.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$99 / quarter</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Before the due date</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/bas-gst-lodgement/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/services/company-annual-compliance/\">Company annual compliance</a></h3>\n<p>ASIC annual review, registers, minutes and the solvency resolution, handled.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">$99 / year + ASIC fee</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Within the review window</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/company-annual-compliance/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"sv-group\" id=\"lodge-a-tax-return\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-head\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Lodge a tax return</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Lodge a tax return online</h2>\n</div>\n<p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:26rem;margin:0\">Prepared and lodged by a registered tax agent, with a fixed fee before we start.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-cards\">\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/individual-tax-return/\">Individual tax return</a></h3>\n<p>Salary, deductions, investments and sole-trader income, reviewed by an accountant.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $99</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing confirmed when you start</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/individual-tax-return/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/company-tax-return/\">Company tax return</a></h3>\n<p>Financial statements and the company return, prepared together.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $899</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing set with your quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/company-tax-return/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/partnership-tax-return/\">Partnership tax return</a></h3>\n<p>The partnership return and each partner&#8217;s share, lodged in one pass.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $549</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing set with your quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/partnership-tax-return/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/trust-tax-return/\">Trust tax return</a></h3>\n<p>Trust accounts, distribution resolutions and the trust return.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $749</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing set with your quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/trust-tax-return/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/smsf-tax-return/\">SMSF annual return</a></h3>\n<p>Accounts, the independent audit and the annual return, in one engagement.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">from $1,099 + $499 audit</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing set with your quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/smsf-tax-return/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-card sv-card\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\"><a href=\"/online-tax-returns/superannuation-refund/\">Super refund</a></h3>\n<p>Claim your super back after leaving Australia (DASP), or track down lost super if you&#8217;re staying.</p>\n<div class=\"sv-meta\"><span class=\"sv-fee\">Fixed fee, quoted first</span><span class=\"sv-turn\">Timing set with your quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"sv-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/online-tax-returns/superannuation-refund/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Bundles</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Set up together, for less</h2>\n<div class=\"hp-tiers sv-bundles\">\n<div class=\"hp-tier hp-tier-pick\">\n<div class=\"hp-tier-flag\">Most popular</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Start-up bundle</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$449</div>\n<div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $78 · plus ASIC fees</div>\n<p>A new company ready to trade, registered in the right order.</p>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-list\">\n<div>Company setup</div>\n<div>ABN and TFN</div>\n<div>GST registration</div>\n<div>Business name</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/start-up-bundle/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier\">\n<div class=\"hp-tier-name\">Trust + corporate trustee</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-price\">$869</div>\n<div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $79 · plus ASIC fee and any duty</div>\n<p>A family trust with a company as trustee, set up together.</p>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-list\">\n<div>Trustee company</div>\n<div>Discretionary trust deed</div>\n<div>Trust ABN and TFN</div>\n<div>GST if it will trade</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/trust-corporate-trustee/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier\">\n<div class=\"hp-tier-name\">SMSF + first year</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-price\"><span style=\"font-size:0.45em;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;margin-right:0.3em\">from</span>$2,099</div>\n<div class=\"sv-save\">Saves $248 · plus the ATO levy</div>\n<p>Your super fund established and carried through year one.</p>\n<div class=\"hp-tier-list\">\n<div>Deed, ABN, TFN and ESA</div>\n<div>Rollover help</div>\n<div>First-year accounts</div>\n<div>Audit and annual return</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-tier-cta\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start</a><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/smsf-setup-first-year/\">Details</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-white\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Not sure which structure?</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Sole trader, company, trust or partnership</h2>\n<p class=\"hp-sec-sub\" style=\"max-width:40rem\">Answer four questions and we&#8217;ll suggest a starting point. We confirm the structure with you before anything is registered.</p>\n<form class=\"sv-quiz\" id=\"sv-quiz\">\n<div class=\"sv-quiz-q\">\n<fieldset>\n<legend>Who owns the business?</legend>\n<div class=\"sv-opts\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"who\" value=\"alone\"><span>Just me</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"who\" value=\"others\"><span>Me and others</span></label></div>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset>\n<legend>Could the business be sued or run up debts?</legend>\n<div class=\"sv-opts\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"risk\" value=\"low\"><span>Low risk</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"risk\" value=\"high\"><span>Real risk</span></label></div>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset>\n<legend>Do you want to share income with family members?</legend>\n<div class=\"sv-opts\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"family\" value=\"no\"><span>No</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"family\" value=\"yes\"><span>Yes</span></label></div>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset>\n<legend>Will you bring in investors or sell it one day?</legend>\n<div class=\"sv-opts\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"grow\" value=\"no\"><span>No</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"grow\" value=\"yes\"><span>Probably</span></label></div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-quiz-r\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"sv-r-tag\">Our suggestion</span><span class=\"sv-r-h\" id=\"sv-r-h\">Answer the questions</span></p>\n<p id=\"sv-r-p\">Your suggested structure will appear here.</p>\n<div id=\"sv-r-a\"></div>\n<p class=\"sv-r-note\">General information only, not advice for your circumstances.</p>\n</div>\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-paper\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">How it works</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Four steps, all online</h2>\n<div class=\"hp-steps sv-steps4\">\n<div class=\"hp-step\">\n<div class=\"hp-step-n\">01</div>\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Sign up and verify your identity</h3>\n<p>Create a free account, then a three-minute electronic ID check on your phone. <a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/identity-verification/\">Every client, every service</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-step\">\n<div class=\"hp-step-n\">02</div>\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\">Upload your details</h3>\n<p>Answer the intake questions and upload your documents into Files.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-step\">\n<div class=\"hp-step-n\">03</div>\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\">We prepare and check</h3>\n<p>A registered agent prepares the work and flags anything missing.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-step\">\n<div class=\"hp-step-n\">04</div>\n<h3 class=\"hp-h3\">We lodge</h3>\n<p>You approve in the portal, and we lodge under our agent number.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-white\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-head\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Fees</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Fixed fees, GST included, government fees shown separately</h2>\n</div>\n<p><a class=\"hp-link\" href=\"/services/pricing/\">See all pricing</a></div>\n<div class=\"sv-fees\">\n<div>\n<h3>Fixed, in writing</h3>\n<p>Every fee is agreed before we start. Nothing is charged until you approve the work. Identity verification is included — never a surcharge.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>GST included</h3>\n<p>The price you see is the price you pay us, with no GST added at the end.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Government fees at cost</h3>\n<p>ASIC, ATO and stamp duty charges are shown separately and passed on without markup.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-paper sv-reviews\" hidden><!-- REVIEWS: paste real client reviews here, then remove the hidden attribute --></p>\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Reviews</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">What clients say</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-white\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell hp-pad\">\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">FAQs</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-h2\">Common questions</h2>\n<div class=\"sv-faq\">\n<details>\n<summary>Is it really all online?</summary>\n<p>Yes. XYZ Accounting is online only. You sign up, upload documents, message us and sign everything in our client portal, so there are no appointments to book.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Do I need to verify my identity?</summary>\n<p>Yes — every client, for every service, before any work starts. It is a three-minute electronic check on your phone (licence or passport, a selfie, matched against government records) and it is included in the fee. For a company, trust or SMSF, each director, trustee or controlling owner does their own check. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Who prepares and lodges my work?</summary>\n<p>BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, a Registered Tax Agent. Every return and registration is prepared or reviewed by a qualified accountant before it is lodged.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>How long does it take?</summary>\n<p>Each service shows its usual turnaround. Most registrations are done within a few business days. Returns depend on when we have your documents, and we confirm the timing with your quote.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>What about government fees?</summary>\n<p>ASIC fees, the ATO SMSF levy and any stamp duty are separate from our fee. We show them before you start and pass them on at cost, without markup.</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>What happens after setup?</summary>\n<p>We can look after what comes next: BAS and GST lodgement, bookkeeping, the company&#8217;s annual ASIC review and the yearly tax return. Your registrations are yours, so you can move them to another accountant at any time.</p>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-band hp-startcta\">\n<div class=\"hp-shell\">\n<div class=\"hp-startcta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"hp-eyebrow\">Ready when you are</p>\n<h2 class=\"hp-startcta-h\">Start online today, or get a fixed-fee quote first.</h2>\n<p class=\"hp-startcta-p\">Tell us what you need and we&#8217;ll come back with one price, in writing, usually within one business day.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-startcta-actions\"><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Start my return</a><a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-ghost\" href=\"/get-a-quote/\">Get a quote</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><script>(function(){var f=document.getElementById('sv-quiz');if(!f)return;f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault()});var R={sole:['Sole trader','The simplest and cheapest way to start. You trade under your own ABN and report the profit on your personal return.','/services/abn-application/','ABN application'],partnership:['Partnership','Two or more people sharing the profit, with a written agreement setting out who owns what.','/services/partnership-setup/','Partnership setup'],company:['Company','A Pty Ltd limits your personal liability, makes it easy to bring in investors and is taxed at the company rate.','/services/start-up-bundle/','Start-up bundle'],trust:['Family trust','A discretionary trust lets you share income among family each year. A company as trustee adds asset protection.','/services/trust-corporate-trustee/','Trust + corporate trustee']};function v(n){var e=f.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');return e?e.value:null}function go(){var a=[v('who'),v('risk'),v('family'),v('grow')];var left=a.filter(function(x){return !x}).length;var h=document.getElementById('sv-r-h'),p=document.getElementById('sv-r-p'),b=document.getElementById('sv-r-a');if(left){h.textContent='Answer the questions';p.textContent=left+' question'+(left>1?'s':'')+' to go.';b.innerHTML='';return}var k=a[3]==='yes'?'company':a[2]==='yes'?'trust':a[1]==='high'?'company':a[0]==='others'?'partnership':'sole';var x=R[k];h.textContent=x[0];p.textContent=x[1];b.innerHTML='<a class=\"hp-btn hp-btn-navy sv-btn-sm\" href=\"'+x[2]+'\">'+x[3]+'</a>'}f.addEventListener('change',go)})();</script></p>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/#faq\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it really all online?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. XYZ Accounting is online only. You sign up, upload documents, message us and sign everything in our client portal, so there are no appointments to book.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to verify my identity?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — every client, for every service, before any work starts. It is a three-minute electronic check on your phone (licence or passport, a selfie, matched against government records) and it is included in the fee. For a company, trust or SMSF, each director, trustee or controlling owner does their own check. How it works .\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who prepares and lodges my work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, a Registered Tax Agent. Every return and registration is prepared or reviewed by a qualified accountant before it is lodged.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does it take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Each service shows its usual turnaround. Most registrations are done within a few business days. Returns depend on when we have your documents, and we confirm the timing with your quote.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What about government fees?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ASIC fees, the ATO SMSF levy and any stamp duty are separate from our fee. We show them before you start and pass them on at cost, without markup.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens after setup?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We can look after what comes next: BAS and GST lodgement, bookkeeping, the company’s annual ASIC review and the yearly tax return. Your registrations are yours, so you can move them to another accountant at any time.\"}}]}</script></div>\n"
